- Added `auth.mdm_windows_one_time_enroll_secrets`. When enabled, a Windows MDM host that Fleet installs fleetd on is sent a per-device, single-use enroll secret instead of the shared global enroll secret. An administrator resending the Fleet-managed "Fleetd enroll secret" configuration profile is how a host whose secret was already used gets another. A shared enroll secret can no longer re-enroll fleetd on an existing host that is enrolled in Fleet Windows MDM.
